hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"743","Abu Shurayh at Adawi (ra) said that his ears heard eyes observed that The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was saying"
"744","Abu Hurayrah (ra) has reported that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said"
"745","Abu Shurayh al-Kabi al-Adawi (ra) has reported that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said"
"746","Al-Miqdam Abu karimah al-Shamee (ra) has reported the prophet j|| as saying"
"747","Uqbah bin Aamir (ra) said that he said to the Prophet (ﷺ)"
"748","Abu Usayd as-Sa'idi invited the Prophet"
"749","Nu'aym ibn Qa'nab said"
"750","Thawban reported that the Prophet"
"751","Abu Mas'ud al-Badri reported that the Prophet"
"752","Jabir said"
"753","a dinar which you give to\na poor person"
"754","Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas transmitted that the Prophet"
"755","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"756","Abu Ruhm"
"757","'A'isha said"
